The '''Plastic Texture Pack'''<ref>{{Cite|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140420012011/http://playxbla.com/its-here-the-plastic-texture-pack-for-minecraft-xbox-360-edition/|title=It’s Here! The Plastic Texture Pack for Minecraft: Xbox 360 Edition!|website=playxbla.com|date=October 2, 2013|author=XBLA_Vulcan}}</ref> is a [[texture pack DLC|texture pack]] that introduces simplistic, colorful textures with angular designs to the game. It was the first texture pack released for [[Legacy Console Edition]] and, along with the [[City Texture Pack]], was one of the first two texture packs released for {{els|be|3ds}}.

