== Player skins ==
{{Exclusive|console|section=1}}
[[File:Plastic Steve.png|x250px|thumb|The Steve skin as it appears with the Plastic Texture Pack applied.]]

When this texture pack is applied, the [[Steve]] skin from the [[Default Skin Pack (Legacy Console Edition)|Default Skin Pack]] is replaced with a different version of the skin that matches the texture pack's plastic aesthetics.

While it is technically possible to replace any of the 18 skins from the Default Skin Pack using a texture or [[mash-up pack]], this functionality was only ever used by this texture pack to change the Steve skin.

